# TODO before submission (P0): each author supplies their own ORCID iD, added
# as a sibling key of the matching author, e.g.
#     orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2721-5266"
# An ORCID search for "runsheng luan" returns exactly one record,
# 0000-0003-2721-5266 (registered 2018, claimed, but with no public content),
# so it may well be yours -- confirm before using it. Searches for Ping Jiang
# and Ming Yang return many namesakes, and none can be disambiguated from the
# public record, so those two have to come from the authors themselves.
# Never guess an iD: attaching the wrong ORCID is a record-level error.
